[00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:05.300]   Good morning, and welcome to Earthstone Energy's second quarter 2020 conference call.
[00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.120]   At this time, all participants are in a listen-only mode.
[00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:11.520]   A brief question and answer session will follow the formal presentation.
[00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.820]   If anyone should require operator assistance during the conference,
[00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.320]   please press star zero on your telephone keypad.
[00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.040]   As a reminder, this conference is being recorded.
[00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.900]   Joining us today from Earthstone are Robert Anderson,
[00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.820]   President and Chief Executive Officer,
[00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:29.720]   Mark Lumpkin, Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer,
[00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.560]   and Scott Thielander, Vice President of Finance.
