[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.360]   Good morning and welcome to the third quarter 2020 Pilgrims Pride Earnings Conference Call and Webcast.
[00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.580]   All participants will be in listen-only mode.
[00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:22.440]   Do you need assistance, please signal a conference specialist by pressing the star key followed by zero.
[00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:26.280]   At the company's request, this call is being recorded.
[00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:39.200]   Please note that the slides referred during today's call are available for download from the Investor Relations section of the company's website at www.pilgrims.com.
[00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.580]   After today's presentation, there will be the opportunity to ask questions.
[00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:50.260]   I would now like to turn the conference over to Danamo Winoto, Head of Investor Relations for Pilgrims Pride.
[00:00:50.260 --> 00:00:51.780]   Please go ahead, sir.
[00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:55.080]   Good morning and thank you for joining us today.
[00:00:55.160 --> 00:01:01.940]   As we review our operating and financial results for the third quarter ended September 27, 2020.
[00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:08.460]   Yesterday afternoon, we issued a press release providing an overview of our financial performance for the quarter,
[00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.260]   including a reconciliation of any non-GAAP measures we may discuss.
[00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:20.580]   A copy of the release is available in the Investor Relations section of our website, along with the slides we will reference during this call.
[00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:25.140]   These items have also been filed as 8Ks and are available online.
[00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:28.680]   If you have any questions, please feel free to reach out to us at www.scc.gov or email us at info@investor-finance.gov.
[00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:39.140]   Presenting to you today are Fabio Sandri, President and Chief Executive Officer, and Chief Financial Officer, and Joe Walbuzer, Head of Commodity Risk Management.
[00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:44.540]   Before we begin our prepared remarks, I'd like to remind everyone of our safe harbor disclaimer.
[00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:53.000]   Today's call contains our forward-looking statements that represent our outlook and current expectations as of the day of this release.
