[00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:15.800]   while adjusting our operations to be able to maintain the operations at all our plants, and minimize any significant disruption due to labor and health issues.
[00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:29.800]   We remain diligent in implementing precautionary, proactive steps to better safeguard the wellness and health of each team member, while fulfilling our essential duty as a food producer to consumers in every region where we operate.
[00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:39.800]   We incurred direct COVID-19 mitigation costs of roughly $27 million for the quarter, and close to $77 million year-to-date.
[00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:53.800]   The direct costs are related to the extra cleaning of our production and common areas, the extra PP&E, including masks and face shields that we are providing to all of our team members, and the installation of physical barriers in our production areas.
[00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:58.800]   We also installed dual-technology UV and bipolar ionization in every plant,
[00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.800]   to filter the air and neutralize potential viruses.
[00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:11.800]   We are offering free light health online services that allow for virtual doctor visits at no cost, and above all CDC guidelines,
[00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:18.800]   we remove vulnerable team members from facilities, with full pay and benefits during community outbreaks.
[00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:27.800]   This figure includes indirect costs that are more difficult to precisely quantify, such as overall disruptions to our operations,
[00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:33.800]   less optimal mix, and production inefficiencies that are not included in these numbers.
[00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:38.800]   Also, we are supporting our communities with our HomeStrong initiative.
[00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:45.800]   It is an example of how we value the important role we play in the communities where our team members live and work.
[00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:50.800]   We understand the responsibility that comes with being a major employer in rural communities,
[00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:56.800]   and we work hard to contribute to the well-being of those communities by not only providing gainful employing opportunities,
