[00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:06.800]   This quarter, we accrued $50 million in SG&A for this initiative.
[00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:12.800]   Turning to the specifics of our business, despite continuing volatility and challenging market environments in Q3,
[00:05:12.800 --> 00:05:18.800]   and added operating costs, we have continued to generate a superior relative performance to the competition,
[00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.800]   and have remained resilient to market fluctuations.
[00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:25.800]   This is a reflection of our portfolio approach, including the strategy
[00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:32.800]   on well-diversified products, broad geographical footprints, and a relentless focus on key customers.
[00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:39.800]   For the full quarter, operating performance, both in U.S. and Mexico, significantly improved sequentially,
[00:05:39.800 --> 00:05:43.800]   and Europe also continued to improve despite the challenges due to COVID-19.
[00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:49.800]   In Q3, we saw market conditions continue to recover across all of our global operations,
[00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:54.800]   with U.S., and particularly Mexico, experiencing the shorter rebound in performance,
[00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:58.800]   relative to weak conditions during the first half of the year.
[00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:02.800]   We are pleased with the results, especially when taking into account all the disruptions,
[00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:08.800]   less than optimal product mix, and added operating costs when compared to the environment in 2019.
[00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:12.800]   Despite continued challenges in global market conditions due to COVID-19,
[00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:16.800]   our consolidated results have also remained well balanced,
[00:06:16.800 --> 00:06:20.800]   and the result of our vision to become the best and most respected company,
[00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:23.800]   creating the opportunity of a better future for our team members.
[00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:26.800]   To support our vision, we are continuing to implement our strategy
[00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:30.800]   of developing a unique portfolio of diverse, complementary business models,
[00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:33.800]   continuing to relentlessly pursue operational excellence,
[00:06:33.800 --> 00:06:36.800]   becoming a more value partner with key customers,
